  "implementation": {
    "api": "Separate NativeImage::preview_ace16_variable_split_updates(table,column,&[SlotScalarUpdate],budget,cancel)->Ace16WritePreview. Existing fixed/slot/page/variable APIs unchanged; selected single General/Binary profiles, NULL/empty and existing constraint gates retained; affected tuples and other held profiles refuse.",
    "one_state": "Staged owns reusable key facts separately from placement. DATA Plan::into_parts moves the sole State to index continuation; immutable Data retains pages/maps/events and builder phase length. No state clone/rebase or synthetic source image.",
    "guards": "Complete original metadata census binds canonical GlobalFree, OrdinaryOwned, OrdinaryCandidate and affected physical IndexOwned roles with complete tails/physical slots. Whole definition chains/map storage pages deny DATA writes. Same Metadata protects noop/root/final targets; actual highest candidate checked before page fit/failed_fit, without original hint/global checks, allowing staged EOF reuse.",
    "composer": "Shared exact-before composer checks original image length, patch overlap and complete contiguous DATA-then-index EOF inventory; ordinary DATA pages and index pages remain separately typed. Shared map vector written once.",
    "certificate": "Opaque CertifiedData borrows exact original NativeImage and composed after slice; rebinds original gates/Metadata/requests, certifies DATA bytes/placements and derives EOF/page purposes/map edits. Keys derive from original expected/requested values and stable ROWs, not builder Staged keys. Source/candidate identity checks prevent scope substitution.",
    "continuation": "Independent index replay starts at certified DATA EOF, seeds only certified byte effects, derives index-only reservations and all map promotion changes, refuses erasing seeded offsets, and certifies complete suffix union. Existing original/fresh prefix, sibling, root and residue policies retained.",
    "consumer": "Dedicated feature-gated preview_ace16_variable_split clap Parser, five positionals; reuses quoted five-field headerless TSV parser and fresh synchronized publication. 4096 requests/16MiB input/1024-byte values/shared 256MiB byte pool/100k rows/100m steps. Requests captured before database open; no source overwrite, preexisting output overwrite or normal CLI path."
  },
